                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#0b0b0b",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Volume grew 258-fold in 21 months, and most of it now goes to Chinese labs: 58.5% of September tokens, up from 6.0% in January 2025. Lab concentration has been below the 1,800 \"highly concentrated\" line every month since Dec 2025 (it first dipped under in Aug 2025), but it has risen since its Apr 2026 low.",
